WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍。

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.060
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金西。

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.360
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.420
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在我们专门为你制作了《办公室》终极重温播客。

6
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有亲历者才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.560
We're The Office ladies.
我们是办公室女郎。

8
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.230
Oh, hi there.
哦，你好呀。

9
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.070
Are you ready to get the girl?
准备好去追求那个女孩了吗？

10
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:30.350
Let's go get her.
我们去把她追回来。

11
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:36.210
All right, it's Season 8, Episode 18, written by Charlie Grandy and directed by Rainn Wilson.
好了，这是第八季第十八集，由查理·格兰迪编剧，雷恩·威尔森执导。

12
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.570
Here's your summary.
这是剧情梗概。

13
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:43.070
Andy drives to Tallahassee to declare his love for Erin and bring her home.
安迪驱车前往塔拉哈西，向艾琳表白并带她回家。

14
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:51.790
Meanwhile, Nellie shows up in Scranton and helps herself to the manager's position and starts offering everyone a raise.
与此同时，内莉出现在斯克兰顿，擅自占用了经理的职位，并开始给每个人加薪。

15
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:52.550
Yeah.
没错。

16
00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.430
Also, Robert California's there, and he just lets it happen.
另外，罗伯特·加利福尼亚也在场，但他顺其自然地由着她胡闹。

17
00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:57.890
We'll get to that.
我们待会儿会聊到这个。

18
00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:58.230
Yeah.
是的。

19
