67
00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.050
That's a great one.
那真的很棒。

68
00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:25.350
Right?
对吧？

69
00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:25.990
Yeah.
是啊。

70
00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.490
Hit me up for audio memos, please.
请找我要音频备忘录吧。

71
