Yeah.
好。

72
00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.110
I'll just lean into your phone and say, save Bandit!
我会凑到你的手机旁说，救救班迪特！

73
00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:32.950
Yeah.
对。

74
00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:33.390
Yeah.
对。

75
00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.470
This is going to change our lives.
这要改变我们的生活了。

76
00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:36.230
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

77
00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.050
