Matt Doherty also said, was anyone else rooting for Aaron to just stay in Florida?
马特·多尔蒂还说，还有人支持亚伦就留在佛罗里达吗？

111
00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.490
I certainly was.
我绝对是。

112
00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:07.810
And a review from Click Clack said this episode was, quote, miserably insufferable, end quote.
来自 Click Clack 的一条评论说这一集，引述，极其令人难以忍受，结束引述。

113
00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:16.140
Yeah.
是啊。

114
00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.500
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

115
