During our breakdown of last day in Florida, we got a letter from Amy in Nova Scotia who told us
在我们回顾在佛罗里达的最后一天时，我们收到了来自新斯科舍省艾米的信，她告诉我们

170
00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:21.520
that there was this crazy thing that happened where people in Canada thought that the new
发生了一件疯狂的事，加拿大的人们认为

